Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-evdev, python3-dbus-next, udev
Description: mouse remapping with optional hardware backends
 Headless evdev/uinput mouse remapping with native HID and optional OpenRazer
 hardware controls. Generic remapping remains available without optional backends.
